  "description": "Design by Contract library for .NET 8+. A direct port of the Java uContract library with .NET-specific improvements.\n\nFeatures:\n• Zero overhead when disabled (lazy evaluation)\n• AsyncLocal support for async/await\n• 17 contract methods (Require, Ensure, Invariant, Old, etc.)\n• Zero external dependencies\n• Full nullable reference type support\n• Thread-safe with recursion guard\n• Reflection-based field comparison (EnsureAssignable)\n• JSON-based state capture (Old<T>)\n\nPerfect for DDD aggregates, value objects, and domain services.",
